OL,3,GNEWSAAs a baby I lived in a protective
OL,4,A'bubble' but after pioneering gene
OL,5,Atherapy I beat Covid twice
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter being born without a functioning
OL,8,Fimmune system, Rhys Evans faced the
OL,9,Fprospect of living the rest of his life
OL,10,Fin a protective "bubble", unable to see
OL,11,Fthe outside world.
OL,13,FBut after receiving pioneering gene
OL,14,Ftherapy at London's Great Ormond Street
OL,15,FHospital, he has gone on to live a
OL,16,Fnormal life, working as stage crew at
OL,17,FButlin's in Minehead, Somerset.
OL,19,FNow 26, he said it is incredible many
OL,20,Fothers have been saved after he was the
OL,21,F"guinea pig" for the treatment 25 years
OL,22,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
