OL,3,GNEWSAAs a baby I lived in a protective
OL,4,A'bubble' but after pioneering gene
OL,5,Atherapy I beat Covid twice
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new gene inserted into his bone
OL,8,Fmarrow helped him to develop an immune
OL,9,Fsystem, and Prof Adrian Thrasher, who
OL,10,Fpioneered the therapy and operated on
OL,11,Fhim, said more than 130 people had
OL,12,Freceived the treatment since 2001.
